'''Update: 5th February 2026, 00:05 UTC'''

We've added a number of worlds back for Deadman: Annihilation ahead of the breach in ~2 hours from now. Four of these are for the 3-60 bracket, two for 61-80, and two for 96+.

We intend to keep these worlds online for the foreseeable, and we hope that it will help with the over-crowding issue experienced with the 19:00 UTC breach. We'll continue to monitor world activity during the course of Deadman and will make changes as we feel necessary.

In addition to this, we believe we've resolved an issue that was sometimes preventing the top 16 players from receiving loot from breach NPC kills. If you experience any further issues with this, please do let us know.

Apologies for the frustration caused during the earlier breach - the chaos was certainly fun to watch, but we appreciate the experience you had was less than ideal.

Thanks for your patience and we'll be back in the morning to update further if needed!

